0..77 Comment "// `Eq.generic` where it derives nothing (#2302): a field with no equality, a"
78..148 Comment "// type the derivation does not yet cover (#2345), the derivation read"
149..224 Comment "// anywhere but as a definition\'s whole body, and a stated type the derived"
225..303 Comment "// equality does not meet. Its laws refuse a field of a sum, whose proof cases"
304..378 Comment "// on the field under a motive (#2374), and a recursion, whose proof is an"
379..392 Comment "// induction."
